model":"category","record_id":"47947381-e1f2-4e15-9a45-2d0808237622","field":"label","lang":"nl","value":"Locatie"},{"model":"category","record_id":"47947381-e1f2-4e15-9a45-2d0808237622","field":"label","lang":"hr","value":"Lokacija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Départ"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Uitchecken"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Odjava"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[0]","lang":"fr","value":"<b>Départ avant 10:00</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[0]","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Uitchecken vóór 10:00</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[0]","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Odjava do 10:00</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[1]","lang":"fr","value":"Laissez les clés à l’endroit convenu ou remettez-les à l’hôte."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[1]","lang":"nl","value":"Laat de sleutels achter op de afgesproken plaats of geef ze aan de gastheer."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[1]","lang":"hr","value":"Ostavite ključe na dogovorenom mjestu ili ih predajte domaćinu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[2]","lang":"fr","value":"Veuillez laver la vaisselle et déposer les déchets dans les conteneurs près de l’allée d’accès."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[2]","lang":"nl","value":"Was alstublieft de afwas en breng het afval naar de containers bij de oprit."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[2]","lang":"hr","value":"Molimo vas da operete posuđe i odnesete otpad u spremnike uz prilaz."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[3]","lang":"fr","value":"Vérifions ensemble l’équipement et l’inventaire."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[3]","lang":"nl","value":"Laten we samen de uitrusting en inventaris controleren."},{"model":"item","record_id":"84008aef-e9ea-4cd4-9c26-e541fd458a25","field":"body[3]","lang":"hr","value":"Zajedno provjerimo opremu i inventar."},{"model":"item","record_id":"679ccec1-e3f4-4970-ba19-866589e86f1a","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Le calme nocturne est en vigueur entre 22:00 et 07:00 — par respect pour les autres hôtes et les voisins."},{"model":"item","record_id":"679ccec1-e3f4-4970-ba19-866589e86f1a","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"De nachtrust geldt tussen 22:00 en 07:00 — vanwege de andere gasten en buren."},{"model":"item","record_id":"679ccec1-e3f4-4970-ba19-866589e86f1a","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Noćni mir vrijedi između 22:00 i 07:00 — zbog drugih gostiju i susjeda."},{"model":"item","record_id":"cb1ff334-6ac5-4b06-9316-8aaf4b90ea02","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Il est strictement interdit de fumer à l’intérieur des appartements."},{"model":"item","record_id":"cb1ff334-6ac5-4b06-9316-8aaf4b90ea02","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Roken in de appartementen is strikt verboden."},{"model":"item","record_id":"cb1ff334-6ac5-4b06-9316-8aaf4b90ea02","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Pušenje u unutrašnjosti apartmana strogo je zabranjeno."},{"model":"item","record_id":"68e1013f-87ab-46f2-ad6e-15cf5446d62f","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Lorsque vous partez, fermez les portes et les fenêtres, et éteignez l’eau, les lumières et les appareils électriques."},{"model":"item","record_id":"68e1013f-87ab-46f2-ad6e-15cf5446d62f","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Wanneer je weggaat, sluit dan de deuren en ramen en zet het water, de lichten en elektrische apparaten uit."},{"model":"item","record_id":"68e1013f-87ab-46f2-ad6e-15cf5446d62f","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Kad odlazite, zatvorite vrata i prozore te isključite vodu, svjetla i električne uređaje."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c79092c7-3c74-4b06-b08e-c25bf992e232","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Le propriétaire n’est pas responsable de l’argent, des bijoux, des titres et autres objets que les hôtes conservent dans l’appartement ou le véhicule."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c79092c7-3c74-4b06-b08e-c25bf992e232","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"De eigenaar is niet aansprakelijk voor geld, sieraden, waardepapieren en andere voorwerpen die gasten in het appartement of voertuig bewaren."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c79092c7-3c74-4b06-b08e-c25bf992e232","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Vlasnik ne odgovara za novac, nakit, vrijednosne papire i druge predmete koje gosti čuvaju u apartmanu ili vozilu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"be1e9d4e-8d95-4cb2-a30b-cec0537acfb1","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"En cas de dommage ou de panne, veuillez en informer immédiatement l’hôte."},{"model":"item","record_id":"be1e9d4e-8d95-4cb2-a30b-cec0537acfb1","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Breng de gastheer bij schade of een storing onmiddellijk op de hoogte."},{"model":"item","record_id":"be1e9d4e-8d95-4cb2-a30b-cec0537acfb1","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"U slučaju oštećenja ili kvara, molimo vas odmah obavijestite domaćina."},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b94ae9a-7415-4040-8f55-52e17f0b7672","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Veuillez éteindre les lumières et les appareils que vous n’utilisez pas — ensemble, nous économisons l’énergie."},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b94ae9a-7415-4040-8f55-52e17f0b7672","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Zet alstublieft de lichten en apparaten die je niet gebruikt uit — samen besparen we energie."},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b94ae9a-7415-4040-8f55-52e17f0b7672","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Molimo vas, ugasite svjetla i uređaje koje ne koristite — zajedno štedimo energiju."},{"model":"item","record_id":"4f04030c-91ee-4853-844a-64817e960436","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Veuillez économiser l’eau chaude et ne jetez pas les serviettes après la première utilisation."},{"model":"item","record_id":"4f04030c-91ee-4853-844a-64817e960436","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Bespaar alstublieft warm water en gooi handdoeken niet weg na het eerste gebruik."},{"model":"item","record_id":"4f04030c-91ee-4853-844a-64817e960436","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Molimo vas, štedite toplu vodu i ne odlažite ručnike nakon prve uporabe."},{"model":"item","record_id":"72fc67c0-f962-4992-b720-16e80ed54fa7","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Pour séjourner dans l'établissement, les clients doivent être âgés de <b>15 ans ou plus</b>."},{"model":"item","record_id":"72fc67c0-f962-4992-b720-16e80ed54fa7","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Om in de accommodatie te verblijven, moeten gasten <b>15 jaar of ouder</b> zijn."},{"model":"item","record_id":"72fc67c0-f962-4992-b720-16e80ed54fa7","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Za boravak u objektu gosti moraju imati <b>15 godina ili više</b>."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1fb046fc-7a23-473b-82ab-cf0d5b2ce8cd","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Veuillez nettoyer le barbecue extérieur après utilisation."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1fb046fc-7a23-473b-82ab-cf0d5b2ce8cd","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Maak de buitenbarbecue na gebruik schoon."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1fb046fc-7a23-473b-82ab-cf0d5b2ce8cd","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Molimo očistite vanjski roštilj nakon upotrebe."},{"model":"item","record_id":"30db866a-2742-40c5-bcc3-e0ec84c327b9","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"La piscine est ouverte de 7:00 à 21:00"},{"model":"item","record_id":"30db866a-2742-40c5-bcc3-e0ec84c327b9","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Het zwembad is geopend van 7:00 tot 21:00"},{"model":"item","record_id":"30db866a-2742-40c5-bcc3-e0ec84c327b9","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Bazen je otvoren od 7:00 do 21:00"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e74d2946-9afa-4dbd-a004-2af3e2b83287","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Le verre est strictement interdit dans la piscine et autour de celle-ci. <b>Utilisez les gobelets en plastique de l'appartement.</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e74d2946-9afa-4dbd-a004-2af3e2b83287","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Glas is strikt verboden in en rond het zwembad. <b>Gebruik de plastic bekers uit het appartement.</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e74d2946-9afa-4dbd-a004-2af3e2b83287","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Staklo je strogo zabranjeno u bazenu i oko njega. <b>Koristite plastične čaše iz apartmana.</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1eb598a5-4c90-436b-9979-8eb3b638a70e","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"L'utilisation de la piscine se fait à vos propres risques."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1eb598a5-4c90-436b-9979-8eb3b638a70e","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Gebruik van het zwembad is op eigen risico."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1eb598a5-4c90-436b-9979-8eb3b638a70e","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Korištenje bazena je na vlastitu odgovornost."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0b4f6b3e-0ad4-437e-932b-6174c3cfb115","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Les enfants de moins de 18 ans doivent être accompagnés de leurs parents."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0b4f6b3e-0ad4-437e-932b-6174c3cfb115","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Kinderen onder de 18 jaar mogen alleen onder begeleiding van hun ouders komen."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0b4f6b3e-0ad4-437e-932b-6174c3cfb115","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Djeca mlađa od 18 godina smiju biti samo u pratnji roditelja."},{"model":"item","record_id":"af0defe5-61c7-4ac4-840a-7de4ef57d485","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Les sauts, la plongée, la course, l'escalade sur les bords, le jet d'objets et les comportements bruyants sont interdits."},{"model":"item","record_id":"af0defe5-61c7-4ac4-840a-7de4ef57d485","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Springen, duiken, rennen, op de randen klimmen, voorwerpen gooien en luid gedrag zijn verboden."},{"model":"item","record_id":"af0defe5-61c7-4ac4-840a-7de4ef57d485","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Zabranjeni su skakanje, ronjenje, trčanje, penjanje po rubovima, bacanje predmeta i glasno ponašanje."},{"model":"item","record_id":"51ae4cdc-78b5-41d9-8235-8ce990e799d3","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Le maillot de bain est obligatoire."},{"model":"item","record_id":"51ae4cdc-78b5-41d9-8235-8ce990e799d3","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Badkleding is verplicht."},{"model":"item","record_id":"51ae4cdc-78b5-41d9-8235-8ce990e799d3","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Kupaći kostim je obavezan."},{"model":"item","record_id":"bfafdf1b-3782-42d9-831a-bac49d26c281","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Veillez à votre hygiène personnelle et ne polluez pas l'eau."},{"model":"item","record_id":"bfafdf1b-3782-42d9-831a-bac49d26c281","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Zorg voor uw persoonlijke hygiëne en vervuil het water niet."},{"model":"item","record_id":"bfafdf1b-3782-42d9-831a-bac49d26c281","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Vodite računa o osobnoj higijeni i ne zagađujte vodu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"53fbe383-0115-4b67-9fb8-39ce23115e54","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Si vous n'utilisez pas les transats, veuillez retirer vos serviettes et effets personnels."},{"model":"item","record_id":"53fbe383-0115-4b67-9fb8-39ce23115e54","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Als je de ligstoelen niet gebruikt, ruim dan je handdoeken en persoonlijke spullen op."},{"model":"item","record_id":"53fbe383-0115-4b67-9fb8-39ce23115e54","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Ako ne koristite ležaljke, molimo pospremite ručnike i osobne stvari."},{"model":"item","record_id":"41c9728a-3da5-4463-ab8d-a05d229f5e64","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Nous nettoyons la piscine et ses abords la nuit. Veuillez donc ne pas laisser d'affaires sur les transats pendant la nuit."},{"model":"item","record_id":"41c9728a-3da5-4463-ab8d-a05d229f5e64","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"We maken het zwembad en de omgeving 's nachts schoon, dus laat 's nachts geen spullen op de ligstoelen liggen."},{"model":"item","record_id":"41c9728a-3da5-4463-ab8d-a05d229f5e64","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Bazen i okolinu čistimo noću, stoga molimo da preko noći ne ostavljate stvari na ležaljkama."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0fe8e8ea-f75e-4e32-9af5-1423254987eb","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Le non-respect des règles peut entraîner l'interruption du séjour sans remboursement."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0fe8e8ea-f75e-4e32-9af5-1423254987eb","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Overtreding van de regels kan leiden tot beëindiging van het verblijf zonder terugbetaling."},{"model":"item","record_id":"0fe8e8ea-f75e-4e32-9af5-1423254987eb","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Kršenje pravila može značiti prekid boravka bez povrata novca."},{"model":"item","record_id":"62fe786a-090b-4fa5-8021-dcb0a104318a","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Tout équipement supplémentaire doit être convenu à l’avance avec l’hôte."},{"model":"item","record_id":"62fe786a-090b-4fa5-8021-dcb0a104318a","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Extra apparatuur moet vooraf met de gastheer worden afgestemd."},{"model":"item","record_id":"62fe786a-090b-4fa5-8021-dcb0a104318a","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Dodatnu opremu potrebno je unaprijed dogovoriti s domaćinom."},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Appartement 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Appartement 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Apartman 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"3 personnes · 1 chambre · balcon"},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"3 personen · 1 slaapkamer · balkon"},{"model":"item","record_id":"92debb19-36ba-4511-b602-1bbb85e6188b","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"3 osobe · 1 spavaća soba · balkon"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Appartement 1"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Appartement 1"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Apartman 1"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"4 personnes · 1 chambre · terrasse"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"4 personen · 1 slaapkamer · terras"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2b9550ee-1e91-4323-bbb9-f8abb8a3666e","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"4 osobe · 1 spavaća soba · terasa"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Portail d’entrée"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Toegangspoort"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Ulazna kapija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Appuyez sur le <strong>bouton gauche</strong> de la télécommande — le voyant s’allumera et le portail commencera à s’ouvrir.</p><p>Le portail reste ouvert pendant 2 minutes, puis se ferme automatiquement.</p><p>Veuillez ne pas vous arrêter trop près de la clôture : le capteur s’y trouve et le portail ne s’ouvrira pas dans ce cas.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Druk op de <strong>linkerknop</strong> op de afstandsbediening — het lampje gaat branden en de poort begint te openen.</p><p>De poort blijft 2 minuten open en sluit daarna automatisch.</p><p>Stop alsjeblieft niet te dicht bij het hek: daar bevindt zich een sensor en de poort gaat in dat geval niet open.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f61527a3-503e-4b3d-91bc-1161d4e96312","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Pritisnite <strong>lijevu tipku</strong> na daljinskom upravljaču — upalit će se lampica i vrata će se početi otvarati.</p><p>Vrata ostaju otvorena 2 minute, a zatim se automatski zatvaraju.</p><p>Molimo vas, nemojte se zaustavljati preblizu ograde: tamo se nalazi senzor i vrata se u tom slučaju neće otvoriti.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Télévision"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Televisie"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Televizija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Allumez le téléviseur avec la télécommande et le bouton marche/arrêt. Pour les contenus en streaming, sélectionnez l’entrée HDMI 1.</p><p>Si aucune image ne s’affiche, vérifiez que la bonne source est sélectionnée sur la télécommande.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Zet de televisie aan met de afstandsbediening en de aan/uitknop. Selecteer voor streamingcontent de ingang HDMI 1.</p><p>Als er geen beeld is, controleer dan of de juiste bron op de afstandsbediening is geselecteerd.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"2d7920a4-6491-4b11-98c4-af6b3dff7227","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Televizor uključite daljinskim upravljačem i tipkom za uključivanje. Za streaming sadržaje odaberite ulaz HDMI 1.</p><p>Ako nema slike, provjerite je li na daljinskom upravljaču odabran ispravan izvor.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Climatisation"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Airconditioning"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Klima-uređaj"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Allumez la climatisation avec la télécommande. La température recommandée est de 24 °C.</p><p>Lorsque vous quittez l’appartement, veuillez éteindre la climatisation et fermer les fenêtres.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Zet de airconditioning aan met de afstandsbediening. De aanbevolen temperatuur is 24 °C.</p><p>Wanneer je het appartement verlaat, zet de airconditioning dan uit en sluit de ramen.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"41d78418-097d-4959-8ba5-19389f26627f","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Klima-uređaj uključite daljinskim upravljačem. Preporučena temperatura je 24 °C.</p><p>Kada napuštate apartman, molimo vas da isključite klima-uređaj i zatvorite prozore.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Enregistrement"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Inchecken"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Prijava"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p><strong>Arrivée à partir de 14:00</strong></p><p>Lors de l’arrivée, l’hôte a besoin de votre pièce d’identité. Seuls les clients enregistrés peuvent séjourner dans l’appartement.</p><p>Veuillez informer l’hôte à l’avance de toute visite éventuelle.</p><p>Lors de l’arrivée, nous vérifions avec l’hôte l’équipement et l’inventaire selon la liste.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p><strong>Inchecken vanaf 14:00</strong></p><p>Bij het inchecken heeft de host je identiteitsbewijs nodig. Alleen geregistreerde gasten mogen in het appartement verblijven.</p><p>Breng de host vooraf op de hoogte van eventueel bezoek.</p><p>Bij het inchecken controleren we samen met de host de uitrusting en inventaris aan de hand van de lijst.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f85f6f77-c57e-4f87-86b2-d11f8673dad2","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p><strong>Prijava od 14:00</strong></p><p>Prilikom prijave domaćin treba Vaš osobni dokument. U apartmanu mogu boraviti samo prijavljeni gosti.</p><p>Molimo Vas da domaćina unaprijed obavijestite o eventualnom posjetu.</p><p>Prilikom prijave zajedno s domaćinom provjeravamo opremu i inventar prema popisu.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5e18d611-97b1-4016-9ca8-332b56205318","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Les animaux de compagnie ne sont malheureusement pas autorisés dans l’établissement.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5e18d611-97b1-4016-9ca8-332b56205318","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Huisdieren zijn helaas niet toegestaan in de accommodatie.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5e18d611-97b1-4016-9ca8-332b56205318","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Kućni ljubimci, nažalost, nisu dopušteni u objektu.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"SUP — location à la journée"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"SUP — daghuur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"SUP — dnevni najam"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"priceUnit","lang":"fr","value":"jour"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"priceUnit","lang":"nl","value":"dag"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"priceUnit","lang":"hr","value":"dan"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>La planche est livrée pliée dans un sac pratique, prête pour l’action. Une pompe manuelle est fournie pour la gonfler en quelques minutes, où et quand vous le souhaitez.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Het board wordt opgevouwen geleverd in een handige tas, klaar voor actie. Er wordt een handpomp meegeleverd, zodat je het in enkele minuten overal en altijd kunt opblazen.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4860043d-3db3-4c26-bd6e-714ebfdbe8ce","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Daska dolazi složena u praktičnoj torbi, spremna za akciju. Priložena je ručna pumpa kako biste je za nekoliko minuta napuhali bilo gdje i bilo kada.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Chauffe-eau"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Boiler"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Bojler"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Le chauffe-eau doit rester allumé pendant toute la durée de votre séjour. Veuillez ne pas l’éteindre — sinon vous n’aurez plus d’eau chaude.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Laat de boiler tijdens je hele verblijf ingeschakeld. Schakel hem niet uit — anders heb je geen warm water meer.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4d89a336-336d-4c64-b832-c85160132a6c","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Bojler neka bude uključen tijekom cijelog Vašeg boravka. Molimo Vas da ga ne isključujete — u suprotnom ćete ostati bez tople vode.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Parking"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Parkeerplaats"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Parkiralište"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Le stationnement est gratuit pour nos clients et est aménagé dans la cour près de la maison.</p><p>Veuillez noter que le propriétaire décline toute responsabilité pour les véhicules, les éventuels dommages qui leur sont causés ou les objets laissés dans le véhicule.</p><p><strong>Borne de recharge pour véhicules électriques</strong></p><p>Une station de recharge pour véhicules électriques est également disponible. Pour l’utiliser, veuillez d’abord contacter l’hôte.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Parkeren is gratis voor onze gasten en geregeld op de binnenplaats naast het huis.</p><p>Houd er rekening mee dat de eigenaar geen verantwoordelijkheid aanvaardt voor voertuigen, eventuele schade eraan of voorwerpen die in het voertuig zijn achtergelaten.</p><p><strong>Laadpunt voor elektrische voertuigen</strong></p><p>Er is ook een laadstation voor elektrische voertuigen beschikbaar. Neem voor gebruik eerst contact op met de host.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8d1c420-1234-4959-87f4-5d7508ff54ce","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Parkiranje je besplatno za naše goste i osigurano je u dvorištu uz kuću.</p><p>Molimo Vas da imate na umu da vlasnik ne preuzima odgovornost za vozila, eventualnu štetu na njima ili predmete ostavljene u vozilu.</p><p><strong>Punjač za električna vozila</strong></p><p>Dostupna je i stanica za punjenje električnih vozila. Za korištenje se najprije obratite domaćinu.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Salle de sport extérieure"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Buitenfitness"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Vanjski fitness"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"L’utilisation de la salle de sport extérieure se fait à vos propres risques."},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"Gebruik van de buitenfitness is op eigen risico."},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"Korištenje vanjskog fitnessa je na vlastitu odgovornost."},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>L’espace de sport extérieur juste à côté des appartements est une façon simple de rester actif au grand air — avec un sac de frappe, une barre, un banc et des poids.</p><p>Dans le coffre à côté de la salle de sport, vous trouverez des poids, des tapis et de petits équipements. Veuillez les ranger après utilisation.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>De buitenfitnessruimte direct naast de appartementen is een eenvoudige manier om actief te blijven in de frisse lucht — met een bokszak, stang, bankje en gewichten.</p><p>In de kist naast de fitnessruimte vind je gewichten, matten en kleine fitnessbenodigdheden. Ruim deze na gebruik weer op.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"fd46cfef-1de9-4bbf-b2d3-b66f2ccad996","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Vanjski fitness prostor odmah uz apartmane jednostavan je način da ostanete aktivni na svježem zraku — s boksačkom vrećom, šipkom, klupom i utezima.</p><p>U sanduku pokraj fitnessa pronaći ćete utege, podloge i sitnu opremu. Molimo Vas da ih nakon korištenja vratite na mjesto.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Barbecue"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Barbecue"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Roštilj"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>L’espace barbecue est idéal pour des soirées détendues et conviviales. La station de barbecue intégrée et le plan de travail vous permettent de cuisiner en plein air, juste à côté des appartements.</p><p><strong>Instructions d’utilisation</strong></p><p>Avant utilisation, ouvrez la vanne de la bouteille de gaz.</p><p>Après utilisation, veillez à fermer le gaz et à nettoyer le barbecue.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>De barbecueplek is perfect voor ontspannen avonden en gezellig samenzijn. Met het ingebouwde barbecuestation en werkblad kun je buiten koken, vlak naast de appartementen.</p><p><strong>Gebruiksaanwijzing</strong></p><p>Open vóór gebruik de kraan van de gasfles.</p><p>Sluit na gebruik altijd het gas af en maak de barbecue schoon.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e25e02e5-bd2d-4191-aa79-2107bdce4bd3","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Prostor za roštilj idealan je za opuštene večeri i druženje. Ugrađena stanica za roštilj i radna površina omogućuju vam kuhanje na otvorenom, odmah pokraj apartmana.</p><p><strong>Upute za upotrebu</strong></p><p>Prije upotrebe otvorite ventil na plinskoj boci.</p><p>Nakon upotrebe obavezno zatvorite plin i očistite roštilj.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"600c3bc9-4bd9-4f2d-9846-e34eefc20abc","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Fuoriseria — Pizza & More"},{"model":"item","record_id":"600c3bc9-4bd9-4f2d-9846-e34eefc20abc","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Fuoriseria — Pizza & More"},{"model":"item","record_id":"600c3bc9-4bd9-4f2d-9846-e34eefc20abc","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Fuoriseria — Pizza & More"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Restaurant Kamin"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Restaurant Kamin"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Restoran Kamin"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"Pour le trajet depuis l’appartement, utilisez l’itinéraire recommandé."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"Gebruik voor de route vanaf het appartement de aanbevolen route."},{"model":"item","record_id":"1a52268e-aa85-40dc-8ef4-1b4d38c674ee","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"Za put od apartmana upotrijebite preporučenu rutu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"cbc8c421-7362-4887-94dd-43e213bb6e58","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Restaurant Marina Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"cbc8c421-7362-4887-94dd-43e213bb6e58","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Restaurant Marina Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"cbc8c421-7362-4887-94dd-43e213bb6e58","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Restoran Marina Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Excursion en bateau avec skipper — 5 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Boottocht met schipper — 5 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Izlet brodom sa skiperom — 5 sati"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"priceUnit","lang":"fr","value":"5 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"priceUnit","lang":"nl","value":"5 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"priceUnit","lang":"hr","value":"5 sati"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Une version plus longue avec davantage d’arrêts baignade et suffisamment de temps pour profiter également des petites villes côtières.</p><p>Jusqu’à 4 personnes, chaque personne supplémentaire +20 € (maximum 7). Embarquement : Marina UP Izola.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Een langere versie met meer zwemstops en voldoende tijd om ook van de kustplaatsjes te genieten.</p><p>Maximaal 4 personen, elke extra persoon +20 € (maximaal 7). Inschepen: Marina UP Izola.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Dulja verzija s više zaustavljanja za kupanje i dovoljno vremena da uživate i u obalnim gradićima.</p><p>Do 4 osobe, svaka dodatna osoba +20 € (najviše 7). Ukrcaj: Marina UP Izola.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"fr","value":"bateau privé et skipper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"nl","value":"privéboot en schipper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"hr","value":"privatni brod i skiper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[1]","lang":"fr","value":"baignade et snorkeling"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[1]","lang":"nl","value":"zwemmen en snorkelen"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[1]","lang":"hr","value":"kupanje i ronjenje s maskom"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[2]","lang":"fr","value":"arrêt à Piranu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[2]","lang":"nl","value":"stop in Piranu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[2]","lang":"hr","value":"zaustavljanje u Piranu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[3]","lang":"fr","value":"boissons fraîches et snacks"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[3]","lang":"nl","value":"koude dranken en snacks"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[3]","lang":"hr","value":"hladna pića i grickalice"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[4]","lang":"fr","value":"accueil avec du prosecco"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[4]","lang":"nl","value":"welkomstdrankje met prosecco"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6617360c-fdc5-455e-9e72-5269106f9a52","field":"bullets[4]","lang":"hr","value":"dobrodošlica s proseccoom"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Jeux de société"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Bordspellen"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Društvene igre"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Une sélection de jeux de plein air et pour les longues après-midis à l’ombre est à votre disposition : raquettes, cartes, jeux de société (dont Človek, ne jezi se) et puzzles.</p><p><strong>Où sont les jeux ?</strong></p><p>Les jeux sont rangés à droite du barbecue, dans une caisse clairement indiquée « Igre ».</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Voor gasten is er een selectie buitenspellen en spellen voor lange middagen in de schaduw: rackets, kaarten, bordspellen (ook Človek, ne jezi se) en puzzels.</p><p><strong>Waar zijn de spellen?</strong></p><p>De spellen liggen rechts van de barbecue, in een kist met het duidelijke opschrift „Igre“.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"4582653e-34e5-4381-a882-1125ada98d2d","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Za goste je pripremljen izbor igara na otvorenom i za duga poslijepodneva u hladu: reketi, karte, društvene igre (uključujući Človek, ne jezi se) i slagalice.</p><p><strong>Gdje su igre?</strong></p><p>Igre su spremljene desno od roštilja, u sanduku s jasnom oznakom „Igre“.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"24679d56-c650-4467-b1c3-66eb46383add","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Restavracija Pavel 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"24679d56-c650-4467-b1c3-66eb46383add","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Restavracija Pavel 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"24679d56-c650-4467-b1c3-66eb46383add","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Restavracija Pavel 2"},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Cafinho Piran"},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Cafinho Piran"},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Cafinho Piran"},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"Pour le trajet depuis l’appartement, utilisez l’itinéraire recommandé."},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"Gebruik voor de route vanaf het appartement de aanbevolen route."},{"model":"item","record_id":"bc14f289-9cde-4ccb-be0b-7e027a2032eb","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"Za put od apartmana upotrijebite preporučenu rutu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Restavracija Pavel"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Restavracija Pavel"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Restavracija Pavel"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"<b>Restaurant de poisson.</b> Pour le trajet depuis l’appartement, utilisez l’itinéraire recommandé."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Visrestaurant.</b> Gebruik voor de route vanaf het appartement de aanbevolen route."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c77950ee-3aeb-4642-b50c-2c8a54c3decb","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Riblji restoran.</b> Za put od apartmana upotrijebite preporučenu rutu."},{"model":"item","record_id":"c43cd525-e975-48f6-89e3-6ae176a61488","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Snack Bar 1964"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c43cd525-e975-48f6-89e3-6ae176a61488","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Snack Bar 1964"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c43cd525-e975-48f6-89e3-6ae176a61488","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Snack Bar 1964"},{"model":"item","record_id":"61805c50-ef8a-466d-ba7c-17435c11ad2a","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Gostilna Karjola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"61805c50-ef8a-466d-ba7c-17435c11ad2a","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Gostilna Karjola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"61805c50-ef8a-466d-ba7c-17435c11ad2a","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Gostilna Karjola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"81534ebf-a421-46e7-8b19-5d5a91406481","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Picerija Vesuvio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"81534ebf-a421-46e7-8b19-5d5a91406481","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Picerija Vesuvio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"81534ebf-a421-46e7-8b19-5d5a91406481","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Picerija Vesuvio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"9cd5d825-6d1c-4380-b99b-54063d5e09b5","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Coco cafe Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"9cd5d825-6d1c-4380-b99b-54063d5e09b5","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Coco cafe Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"9cd5d825-6d1c-4380-b99b-54063d5e09b5","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Coco cafe Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Hiša Dual"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Hiša Dual"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Hiša Dual"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"<b>Réservation :</b> Dunja, +386 70 577 069"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Reservering:</b> Dunja, +386 70 577 069"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a6f363e4-0521-482a-a9c6-30234a23b5d4","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Rezervacija:</b> Dunja, +386 70 577 069"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e5bf6696-9720-4fb2-a09f-58f2aaaff750","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Barba bar & more"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e5bf6696-9720-4fb2-a09f-58f2aaaff750","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Barba bar & more"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e5bf6696-9720-4fb2-a09f-58f2aaaff750","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Barba bar & more"},{"model":"item","record_id":"acf6ef93-c287-41b9-97ad-f6ae4ced2862","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Wakanda Beach Bar"},{"model":"item","record_id":"acf6ef93-c287-41b9-97ad-f6ae4ced2862","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Wakanda Beach Bar"},{"model":"item","record_id":"acf6ef93-c287-41b9-97ad-f6ae4ced2862","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Wakanda Beach Bar"},{"model":"item","record_id":"442b143e-0ed0-48d8-ae5a-9deb4f81fa13","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Club Alaya"},{"model":"item","record_id":"442b143e-0ed0-48d8-ae5a-9deb4f81fa13","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Club Alaya"},{"model":"item","record_id":"442b143e-0ed0-48d8-ae5a-9deb4f81fa13","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Club Alaya"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Glace 24/7"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"IJs 24/7"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Sladoled 24/7"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p><strong>Meli Pu Ice Cream</strong></p><p>Notre distributeur automatique de glaces à Marina Izola fonctionne 24 heures sur 24, tous les jours de la semaine. Si l’envie vous prend après le dîner ou après minuit — passez donc nous voir.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p><strong>Meli Pu Ice Cream</strong></p><p>Onze ijsautomaat in Marina Izola werkt 24 uur per dag, alle dagen van de week. Als je na het diner of na middernacht trek krijgt — kom gerust langs.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7a885dec-33af-48d6-b883-d98a6a2a2ee0","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p><strong>Meli Pu Ice Cream</strong></p><p>Naš automat za sladoled u Marini Izola radi 24 sata dnevno, svaki dan u tjednu. Kad vam se nakon večere ili poslije ponoći jede sladoled — samo navratite.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Excursion sur mesure"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Excursie op maat"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Izlet po dogovoru"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Dites-nous ce que vous souhaitez, et le skipper préparera une navigation sur mesure.</p><p>Jusqu’à 4 personnes, chaque personne supplémentaire +20 € (maximum 7).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Vertel ons wat je wilt, en de schipper stelt een vaartocht op maat samen.</p><p>Tot 4 personen, elke extra persoon +20 € (maximaal 7).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6a4d3a34-8d54-49d4-bd68-8ea31f019edf","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Recite nam što želite, a skiper će pripremiti plovidbu po vašoj mjeri.</p><p>Do 4 osobe, svaka dodatna osoba +20 € (najviše 7).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"Cette petite ville médiévale au sommet d’une colline, au cœur de la campagne istrienne, est l’une des images les plus reconnaissables de l’Istrie grâce à ses remparts resserrés et à sa vue. Depuis le vieux centre, on aperçoit la vallée de la rivière Mirna avec la forêt de Motovun, connue pour ses truffes. Une route escarpée mène à la ville, puis le dernier tronçon se parcourt à pied à travers les portes de la ville — cette montée fait partie de l’expérience. Il est possible de faire le tour des remparts ; en contrebas, dans la vallée, la piste cyclable Parenzana suit le tracé de l’ancienne voie ferrée à voie étroite."},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"Het middeleeuwse stadje op de top van een heuvel midden in het Istrische binnenland is, dankzij de aaneengesloten stadsmuren en het uitzicht, een van de meest herkenbare beelden van Istrië. Vanuit de oude kern zie je de vallei van de rivier Mirna met het Motovun-bos, bekend om zijn truffels. Een steile weg leidt naar de stad, en het laatste deel leg je te voet af door de stadspoort — juist die klim maakt deel uit van de belevenis. Je kunt in een rondje over de stadsmuren lopen; beneden in de vallei loopt de fietsroute Parenzana over het tracé van de voormalige smalspoorlijn."},{"model":"item","record_id":"89d393c9-628e-4514-99f0-25a3a89bf1f4","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"Srednjovjekovni gradić na vrhu brežuljka usred istarskog zaleđa jedna je od najprepoznatljivijih istarskih slika zbog zbijenih gradskih zidina i pogleda. Iz stare jezgre vidi se dolina rijeke Mirne s Motovunskom šumom, poznatom po tartufima. Do grada vodi strma cesta, a posljednji dio prolazi se pješice kroz gradska vrata — upravo je taj uspon dio doživljaja. Zidine se mogu obići u krugu; dolje u dolini vodi biciklistička staza Parenzana trasom nekadašnje uskotračne željeznice."},{"model":"item","record_id":"5f9e20a8-8a53-4b7b-b8a0-e8e0cbda531c","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5f9e20a8-8a53-4b7b-b8a0-e8e0cbda531c","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5f9e20a8-8a53-4b7b-b8a0-e8e0cbda531c","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Motovun"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c3d3c32d-6ca6-46e1-b446-69b2063b6c55","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Parc paysager des salines de Sečovlje"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c3d3c32d-6ca6-46e1-b446-69b2063b6c55","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Landschapspark Sečovlje-zoutpannen"},{"model":"item","record_id":"c3d3c32d-6ca6-46e1-b446-69b2063b6c55","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Park prirode Sečoveljske soline"},{"model":"item","record_id":"77c0863e-b6da-48df-beda-f5c7cf81d8b6","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Événements à Izoli"},{"model":"item","record_id":"77c0863e-b6da-48df-beda-f5c7cf81d8b6","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Evenementen in Izoli"},{"model":"item","record_id":"77c0863e-b6da-48df-beda-f5c7cf81d8b6","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Događanja u Izoli"},{"model":"item","record_id":"43381ade-d6e1-4ca7-bed7-9f14b4518f07","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Événements à Portorožu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"43381ade-d6e1-4ca7-bed7-9f14b4518f07","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Evenementen in Portorožu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"43381ade-d6e1-4ca7-bed7-9f14b4518f07","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Događanja u Portorožu"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f2923fa6-1a82-445c-9dfb-bf4dbd504f8c","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Appartement 3"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f2923fa6-1a82-445c-9dfb-bf4dbd504f8c","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Appartement 3"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f2923fa6-1a82-445c-9dfb-bf4dbd504f8c","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Apartman 3"},{"model":"item","record_id":"040e3521-dfc6-4f20-a6a9-fb3dfd1d5b14","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Appartement 4"},{"model":"item","record_id":"040e3521-dfc6-4f20-a6a9-fb3dfd1d5b14","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Appartement 4"},{"model":"item","record_id":"040e3521-dfc6-4f20-a6a9-fb3dfd1d5b14","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Apartman 4"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Emplacement"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Locatie"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Lokacija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p><strong>Comment nous rejoindre</strong></p><p>Vous nous trouverez à l'adresse Malija 143b à Izoli. Comme Google Maps vous indique parfois le mauvais chemin, nous avons décrit l'itinéraire nous-mêmes — suivez ces instructions et vous ne pourrez pas vous tromper.</p><p>Depuis Koper, en passant par le tunnel en direction d'Izoli, prenez la première sortie pour Izoli. Au rond-point, prenez la deuxième sortie, puis après environ 50 mètres, au rond-point suivant, prenez la troisième sortie.</p><p>Continuez tout droit sur environ 500 mètres jusqu'au rond-point suivant et prenez à nouveau la troisième sortie (direction Korte, Šared). Vous passerez devant Hofer sur votre droite.</p><p>Au petit rond-point, continuez tout droit (deuxième sortie). Une montée d'environ 3 km suit, en passant par le village de Šared.</p><p>Environ 800 mètres après Šared, vous verrez un panneau pour Malija — tournez à droite. Après 500 mètres supplémentaires, un panneau pour Malo Sevo se trouve sur la droite — tournez-y.</p><p>Continuez encore environ 800 mètres à travers un petit village. <strong>Nous sommes la dernière maison à droite.</strong></p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p><strong>Hoe je ons bereikt</strong></p><p>Je vindt ons op het adres Malija 143b in Izoli. Omdat Google Maps je soms via de verkeerde route stuurt, hebben we de route zelf beschreven — houd je aan deze aanwijzingen en je kunt niet verkeerd rijden.</p><p>Rijd vanuit Koper door de tunnel richting Izoli en neem de eerste afslag naar Izoli. Neem op de rotonde de tweede afslag en na ongeveer 50 meter bij de volgende rotonde de derde afslag.</p><p>Rijd ongeveer 500 meter rechtdoor tot aan de volgende rotonde en neem opnieuw de derde afslag (richting Korte, Šared). Aan je rechterkant rijd je langs Hofer.</p><p>Ga bij de kleinere rotonde rechtdoor (tweede afslag). Daarna volgt een klim van ongeveer 3 km langs het dorp Šared.</p><p>Ongeveer 800 meter na Šared staat er een bord naar Malija — sla rechtsaf. Na nog eens 500 meter staat er rechts een bord naar Malo Sevo — sla daar af.</p><p>Rijd nog ongeveer 800 meter door een kleine nederzetting. <strong>Wij zijn het laatste huis aan de rechterkant.</strong></p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3d05a9a7-30c8-45b8-84c8-e77a415f5741","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p><strong>Kako doći do nas</strong></p><p>Nalazimo se na adresi Malija 143b u Izoli. Budući da vas Google Maps ponekad navede pogrešnim putem, sami smo opisali rutu — držite se ovih uputa i ne možete pogriješiti.</p><p>Iz Kopra kroz tunel prema Izoli skrenite na prvom izlazu za Izoli. Na kružnom toku odaberite drugi izlaz, a nakon približno 50 metara na sljedećem kružnom toku treći izlaz.</p><p>Nastavite ravno oko 500 metara do sljedećeg kružnog toka i ponovno skrenite na treći izlaz (smjer Korte, Šared). S desne strane proći ćete pokraj Hoferja.</p><p>Na manjem kružnom toku nastavite ravno (drugi izlaz). Slijedi uspon od približno 3 km pokraj sela Šared.</p><p>Oko 800 metara nakon Šareda nalazi se znak za Maliju — skrenite desno. Nakon daljnjih 500 metara s desne strane je znak za Malo Sevo — skrenite tamo.</p><p>Vozite još približno 800 metara kroz manje naselje. <strong>Mi smo zadnja kuća s desne strane.</strong></p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"345518cc-ed6f-470f-ba1c-0ec0dd854bf1","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Lidl Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"345518cc-ed6f-470f-ba1c-0ec0dd854bf1","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Lidl Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"345518cc-ed6f-470f-ba1c-0ec0dd854bf1","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Lidl Portorož"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"WiFi"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"WiFi"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"WiFi"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Nom du réseau : MeliPu</p><p>Mot de passe : MeliPu0301</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Netwerknaam: MeliPu</p><p>Wachtwoord: MeliPu0301</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"91becb6d-b58c-43e9-8ef3-5b3fdd479084","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Naziv mreže: MeliPu</p><p>Lozinka: MeliPu0301</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5a92ab27-d474-4ad5-abc1-67b26697d54b","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Événements à Kopru"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5a92ab27-d474-4ad5-abc1-67b26697d54b","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Evenementen in Kopru"},{"model":"item","record_id":"5a92ab27-d474-4ad5-abc1-67b26697d54b","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Događanja u Kopru"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f353cfc0-69ea-4200-8cca-12618de5147d","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Distributeur automatique Intesa Sanpaolo"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f353cfc0-69ea-4200-8cca-12618de5147d","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Geldautomaat Intesa Sanpaolo"},{"model":"item","record_id":"f353cfc0-69ea-4200-8cca-12618de5147d","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Bankomat Intesa Sanpaolo"},{"model":"item","record_id":"801ca580-a48a-4cfe-9d06-a62e482e6792","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Boulangerie Dan in noč"},{"model":"item","record_id":"801ca580-a48a-4cfe-9d06-a62e482e6792","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Bakkerij Dan in noč"},{"model":"item","record_id":"801ca580-a48a-4cfe-9d06-a62e482e6792","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Pekarnica Dan in noč"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1edbfdae-42fb-48e0-85c0-e263e958adc5","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Petrol Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1edbfdae-42fb-48e0-85c0-e263e958adc5","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Petrol Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"1edbfdae-42fb-48e0-85c0-e263e958adc5","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Petrol Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"019d30b8-ee97-4165-af5d-a230eb474240","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Supermarché Tuš Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"019d30b8-ee97-4165-af5d-a230eb474240","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Tuš-supermarkt Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"019d30b8-ee97-4165-af5d-a230eb474240","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Supermarket Tuš Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e1551666-4f21-455c-95d9-b2e4658c497e","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Boulangerie Portorož — Panificio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e1551666-4f21-455c-95d9-b2e4658c497e","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Bakkerij Portorož — Panificio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e1551666-4f21-455c-95d9-b2e4658c497e","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Pekarnica Portorož — Panificio"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d056bb6f-da6a-44dc-bf94-a9328db7b063","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Hôpital général d’Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d056bb6f-da6a-44dc-bf94-a9328db7b063","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Algemeen ziekenhuis Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d056bb6f-da6a-44dc-bf94-a9328db7b063","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Opća bolnica Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Bienvenue"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Welkom"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Dobro došli"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p><strong>Nous sommes ravis que vous soyez ici.</strong></p><p>Nous sommes heureux que vous ayez choisi les appartements Meli Pu pour votre séjour. Notre maison se trouve sur un versant ensoleillé au-dessus d’Izola, entourée d’oliviers et de cyprès, avec une vue qui s’étend jusqu’à la mer.</p><p>Nous vous souhaitons des journées détendues, chaleureuses et insouciantes dans notre petit coin de paradis. Si vous avez besoin de quoi que ce soit, nous ne sommes qu’à un appel.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p><strong>Fijn dat je er bent.</strong></p><p>We zijn blij dat je voor je verblijf de appartementen Meli Pu hebt gekozen. Ons huis ligt op een zonnige helling boven Izola, omringd door olijfbomen en cipressen, met een uitzicht dat helemaal tot aan de zee reikt.</p><p>We wensen je ontspannen, warme en zorgeloze dagen in ons kleine stukje paradijs. Als je iets nodig hebt, zijn we maar één telefoontje verwijderd.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"b6416567-e2b4-4ece-8d38-43ec45c7820a","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p><strong>Drago nam je što ste ovdje.</strong></p><p>Veseli nas što ste za svoj odmor odabrali apartmane Meli Pu. Naša kuća nalazi se na sunčanoj padini iznad Izole, okružena maslinama i čempresima, s pogledom koji seže sve do mora.</p><p>Želimo Vam opuštene, tople i bezbrižne dane u našem malom komadiću raja. Ako Vam bilo što zatreba, udaljeni smo samo jedan poziv.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"59c009cc-ed26-42a6-84f5-3053a79820d4","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"MOL Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"59c009cc-ed26-42a6-84f5-3053a79820d4","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"MOL Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"59c009cc-ed26-42a6-84f5-3053a79820d4","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"MOL Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Obalne lekarne — Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Obalne lekarne — Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Obalne lekarne — Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"<b>Pharmacie de garde 24/7</b> — en dehors des heures d’ouverture habituelles, sonnez à la sonnette de garde."},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Dienstapotheek 24/7</b> — buiten de reguliere openingstijden bel je aan bij de dienstbel."},{"model":"item","record_id":"79b8c239-d609-4f3f-bae4-535033cba1e0","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Dežurna ljekarna 24/7</b> — izvan redovitog radnog vremena pozvonite na dežurno zvono."},{"model":"item","record_id":"207c6a04-a090-4d28-acb8-63c629eddf52","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Petrol — Jagodje jug"},{"model":"item","record_id":"207c6a04-a090-4d28-acb8-63c629eddf52","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Petrol — Jagodje jug"},{"model":"item","record_id":"207c6a04-a090-4d28-acb8-63c629eddf52","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Petrol — Jagodje jug"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6856ddbf-5b3b-4ff9-831d-14c06b87184f","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Distributeur SKB"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6856ddbf-5b3b-4ff9-831d-14c06b87184f","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Geldautomaat SKB"},{"model":"item","record_id":"6856ddbf-5b3b-4ff9-831d-14c06b87184f","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Bankomat SKB"},{"model":"item","record_id":"8fbe59b9-7c91-493c-873e-02341771048e","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"MOL Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"8fbe59b9-7c91-493c-873e-02341771048e","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"MOL Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"8fbe59b9-7c91-493c-873e-02341771048e","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"MOL Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8f04d4c-aaa4-4f69-b1f2-c4da10598e68","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Eurospin Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8f04d4c-aaa4-4f69-b1f2-c4da10598e68","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Eurospin Izola"},{"model":"item","record_id":"e8f04d4c-aaa4-4f69-b1f2-c4da10598e68","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Eurospin Izola"