ield":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Winkelcentrum</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"7948f2b0-1055-47c6-b096-731722d30720","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Trgovački centar</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"da96d867-dbbc-4df5-93cb-83f71a40a13a","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Obalne lekarne — Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"da96d867-dbbc-4df5-93cb-83f71a40a13a","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Obalne lekarne — Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"da96d867-dbbc-4df5-93cb-83f71a40a13a","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Obalne lekarne — Lucija"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Planet Tuš Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Planet Tuš Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Planet Tuš Koper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"<b>Centre commercial</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"<b>Winkelcentrum</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"3c4ebc7e-6081-4424-8949-d6af4a0309c6","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"<b>Trgovački centar</b>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Location pour 3-4 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Huur voor 3-4 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Najam za 3-4 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"priceUnit","lang":"fr","value":"3-4 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"priceUnit","lang":"nl","value":"3-4 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"priceUnit","lang":"hr","value":"3-4 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>La planche est livrée pliée dans un sac pratique, prête pour l’action. Une pompe manuelle est fournie pour la gonfler en quelques minutes, où et quand vous le souhaitez.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Het board wordt opgevouwen geleverd in een handige tas, klaar voor actie. Er wordt een handpomp meegeleverd, zodat je het in enkele minuten overal en altijd kunt opblazen.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"048efd21-d9ed-45ce-a017-cda9776fd651","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Daska dolazi složena u praktičnoj torbi, spremna za akciju. Priložena je ručna pumpa kako biste je za nekoliko minuta napuhali bilo gdje i bilo kada.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Scooter — location de 3 à 4 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Scooter — huur voor 3 tot 4 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Skuter — najam na 3 do 4 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"noteText","lang":"fr","value":"La conduite du scooter est sous votre propre responsabilité."},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"noteText","lang":"nl","value":"Het rijden op de scooter is op eigen risico."},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"noteText","lang":"hr","value":"Vožnja skuterom je na vlastitu odgovornost."},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"priceUnit","lang":"fr","value":"3–4 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"priceUnit","lang":"nl","value":"3–4 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"priceUnit","lang":"hr","value":"3–4 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Louez un scooter et explorez à votre rythme — rapide, amusant et parfait pour une aventure de vacances. Deux casques sont inclus.</p><p><strong>Carburant :</strong> vous récupérez le véhicule avec le réservoir plein et le rendez de la même manière, sinon le carburant vous sera facturé.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Huur een scooter en ontdek op je eigen manier — snel, leuk en perfect voor een vakantieavontuur. Twee helmen zijn inbegrepen.</p><p><strong>Brandstof:</strong> je haalt het voertuig op met een volle tank en brengt het ook zo terug, anders brengen we brandstof in rekening.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"d16868d6-d2c1-4485-9380-b9ebe3c04b40","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Unajmite skuter i istražujte na svoj način — brzo, zabavno i savršeno za pustolovinu na odmoru. Uključene su dvije kacige.</p><p><strong>Gorivo:</strong> vozilo preuzimate s punim spremnikom i tako ga i vraćate, u suprotnom naplaćujemo gorivo.</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"title","lang":"fr","value":"Excursion en bateau avec skipper — 3 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"title","lang":"nl","value":"Boottocht met schipper — 3 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"title","lang":"hr","value":"Izlet brodom sa skiperom — 3 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"priceUnit","lang":"fr","value":"3 heures"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"priceUnit","lang":"nl","value":"3 uur"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"priceUnit","lang":"hr","value":"3 sata"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"body","lang":"fr","value":"<p>Ressentez la liberté d'une navigation privée avec votre propre skipper. Divertissement, détente et vues sur la côte slovène — rien que pour votre groupe.</p><p>Jusqu'à 4 personnes, chaque personne supplémentaire +20 € (maximum 7). Embarquement : Marina UP Izola ; également possible à Kopru, Piranu, Portorožu et Bernardinu (+40 €).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"body","lang":"nl","value":"<p>Ervaar de vrijheid van privévaren met je eigen schipper. Plezier, ontspanning en uitzicht op de Sloveense kust — alleen voor je gezelschap.</p><p>Tot 4 personen, elke extra persoon +20 € (maximaal 7). Inschepen: Marina UP Izola; ook mogelijk in Kopru, Piranu, Portorožu en Bernardinu (+40 €).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"body","lang":"hr","value":"<p>Osjetite slobodu privatne plovidbe s vlastitim skiperom. Zabava, opuštanje i pogledi na slovensku obalu — samo za vašu grupu.</p><p>Do 4 osobe, svaka dodatna osoba +20 € (najviše 7). Ukrcavanje: Marina UP Izola; moguće i u Kopru, Piranu, Portorožu i Bernardinu (+40 €).</p>"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"fr","value":"bateau privé et skipper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"nl","value":"privéboot en schipper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"bullets[0]","lang":"hr","value":"privatni brod i skiper"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"bullets[1]","lang":"fr","value":"baignade et snorkeling"},{"model":"item","record_id":"a1b3f0a4-4d72-4698-ae00-2c975cad3d09","field":"bullets[1]","lang":"nl","value":"zwemmen en snorkelen"},{"model":"item",